# Sharifi & Wick MEAM potential for Cr-Ni-Co (NIST entry 2025--Sharifi-H--Cr-Ni-Co--LAMMPS--ipr1).
# Every LAMMPS input in this repository includes this file. Start LAMMPS from the repository root.
#
# Atom types in all data files (set by build_cell.py): 1 = Ni, 2 = Co, 3 = Cr.
# The parameter files list the elements in the order Cr Ni Co; the last three names map types 1, 2, 3.
pair_style  meam
pair_coeff  * * potential/library.meam Cr Ni Co potential/CrNiCo.meam Ni Co Cr
